Tidy: cleaning and repair of HTML documents with libtidy (tidy-html5)
of the package az.

The module tidy of PHP 5.6 for php56 of azsupport/ports,
which installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20131226/tidy.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php56/conf.d,
its headers in include/php56/php/ext/tidy.
